onal refresh token</li><li class=3D"">This JWT can be used in the <code cla=
ss=3D"">configureAuthenticatedSession</code>=EF=BB=BF request to login to a=
 session</li></ol><a id=3D"implicit-flow" class=3D"toc-link toc-link-h3" hr=
