=3D"">response_type=3Did_token</code></li></ol><ol start=3D"3" class=3D""><=
li class=3D"">The authorization service authenticates the customer</li></ol=
><ol start=3D"4" class=3D""><li class=3D"">The end-user grants permissions =
and is redirected back with an <code class=3D"">id_token</code></li></ol><o=
